User Story: Ability to Set Appearance Between Light Mode/Dark Mode/System Default - iOS & Android
Task: Release a Beta Version and Gather User Feedback

Overview:
As a tester, I verified the functionality of the new appearance settings in the beta version across iOS and Android platforms.
Testing included transitions between light, dark, and system default modes, ensuring visual consistency and adherence to platform guidelines. 
Feedback from beta users highlighted satisfaction with the feature, with no major usability or functionality issues reported.
